{
  "_comment": "Emberreach progression tasks. Objectives are evaluated against authoritative state only (PlayerData.stats lifetime counters or live inventory), never against session-local variables. Objective kinds: have_item (currently held), gain_item (lifetime), skill_level, mastery_level, kill_monster, defeat_boss, complete_dungeon, craft_item (lifetime, player-produced), do_actions (lifetime), reach_region, buy_upgrade, build_structure, gp_total (lifetime earned), unlock_pet, discover_items. Rewards are granted exactly once, on explicit claim.",
  "first_firewood": {
    "id": "first_firewood",
    "name": "First Firewood",
    "chapter": 1,
    "region": "farmlands",
    "description": "The survey stakes are in and the hearth is cold. Emberreach needs timber before it needs anything else.",
